#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:374
msgid "Treatment and Repatriation Expenses €196,000.00"
msgstr "Despesas com tratamento e repatriamento: 196.000,00 €"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:251 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:277
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:383
msgid "Leave a review"
msgstr "Deixe um comentário"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:253 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:279
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:385
msgid "You can read more reviews, and we are thankful if you write us one."
msgstr "Pode ler mais avaliações, e agradecemos se escrever uma."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:278 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:305
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:415
msgid "Where to find us?"
msgstr "Onde nos encontramos?"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:280 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:307
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:417
msgid "Open daily from 09:00AM until 06:00PM."
msgstr "Aberto diariamente das 09:00 às 18:00."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:282 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:309
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:419
msgid ""
"You can find us daily, right on Carvoeiro's beach sands, and feel free to "
"approach our co-workers."
msgstr ""
"Pode encontrar-nos diariamente, mesmo na areia da praia do Carvoeiro, e "
"sinta-se à vontade para conversar com os nossos colegas."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:286 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:313
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:423
msgid "We really appreciate it if you can book our services in advance."
msgstr "Agradecemos se puder reservar os nossos serviços com antecedência."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:290 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:317
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:427
msgid "Our address:"
msgstr "O nosso endereço:"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:294
msgid "Dolphins & wildlife"
msgstr "Golfinhos e vida selvagem"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:302
msgid "Kayak & paddle"
msgstr "Caiaque e remo"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:304 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:331
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:442
msgid ""
"Please contact us for reservations and for any questions regarding the boat "
"tour and offers!"
msgstr ""
"Contacte-nos para reservas e para qualquer dúvida sobre o passeio de barco e "
"ofertas!"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:310
msgid "Benagil & the caves"
msgstr "Benagil e as grutas"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:329
msgid "Your day on the water"
msgstr "O seu dia na água"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:330
msgid "Ready to see the caves from the water?"
msgstr "Pronto para ver as grutas a partir da água?"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:332 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:359
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:473
msgid "Note: Call costs to mobile network."
msgstr "Nota: o custo da chamada é para a rede móvel."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:335 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:362
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:476
msgid ""
"You may incur monetary costs while calling our phone number, as it will be a "
"call to a Portuguese telephone."
msgstr ""
"Poderá haver custos monetários ao ligar para o nosso número de telefone, uma "
"vez que será uma chamada para um número de telefone português."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:359 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:391
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:506
msgid "Tour duration"
msgstr "Duração da excursão"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:360 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:392
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:507
msgid "2 hours"
msgstr "2 horas"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:362 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:394
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:509
msgid "Boarding location"
msgstr "Local de embarque"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:367 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:399
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:514
msgid ""
"This program includes a brief stop by the beach to dive whenever be possible."
msgstr ""
"Este programa inclui uma breve paragem na praia para mergulho, sempre que "
"possível."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:371 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:403
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:518
msgid ""
"Experience the breathtaking beauty of Portugal's stunning Algarve coastline "
"on this tour. The boarding is done in Carvoeiro, we provide transport to "
"Ferragudo to start the tour."
msgstr ""
"Descubra a beleza estonteante da deslumbrante costa algarvia, em Portugal, "
"nesta excursão. O embarque é feito em Carvoeiro e nós providenciamos o "
"transporte até Ferragudo para o início do passeio."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:375 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:407
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:522
msgid ""
"We are a team of professionals, passionate about the sea, who are dedicated "
"to their work to make your trip a unique and unforgettable moment!"
msgstr ""
"Somos uma equipa de profissionais apaixonados pelo mar, dedicados ao nosso "
"trabalho para tornar a sua viagem num momento único e inesquecível!"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:379 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:411
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:526
msgid ""
"The trip will start heading to the dolphins habitat and on the way back we "
"visit Praia da Marinha, Algar de Benagil, Olhos de Deus, the largest cave in "
"the Algarve, and much more."
msgstr ""
"A excursão terá início com uma visita ao habitat dos golfinhos e, no "
"regresso, visitaremos a Praia da Marinha, o Algar de Benagil, os Olhos de "
"Deus, a maior gruta do Algarve, e muito mais."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:383 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:415
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:530
msgid ""
"Our professionals like to share their extensive knowledge about the region, "
"as well as marine life, and the local ecosystem, ensuring that all our "
"passengers can fully understand and appreciate the wonderful marine life."
msgstr ""
"Os nossos profissionais gostam de partilhar o seu vasto conhecimento sobre a "
"região, bem como sobre a vida marinha e o ecossistema local, garantindo que "
"todos os nossos passageiros possam compreender e apreciar plenamente a "
"maravilhosa vida marinha."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:387 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:419
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:535
msgid "Health & Safety"
msgstr "Saúde e Segurança"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:389 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:421
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:537
msgid ""
"We do not recommend the speed boat tour to people with serious back "
"problems, or weighing more than 120kg and pregnant women in late stages of "
"pregnancy."
msgstr ""
"Não recomendamos o passeio de lancha a pessoas com problemas graves de "
"coluna, com peso superior a 120 kg ou a grávidas em estado avançado de "
"gestação."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:392 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:424
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:540
msgid "Included"
msgstr "Incluído"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:393 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:425
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:541
msgid "Life jacket, Waterproofing when necessary."
msgstr "Colete salva-vidas, impermeabilização quando necessário."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:396 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:428
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:544
msgid "Not included"
msgstr "Não incluído"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:397 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:429
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:545
msgid "Swimsuit, towel, sun lotion, sunglasses."
msgstr "Fato de banho, toalha, protetor solar, óculos de sol."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:400 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:432
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:548
msgid "Cancellation policy"
msgstr "Política de cancelamento"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:402 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:434
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:550
msgid ""
"For a full refund, cancel at least 24 hours in advance of the tour start "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Para obter o reembolso total, cancele com pelo menos 24 horas de "
"antecedência da data de início do passeio."

